{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_25\">Problem 25</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 25\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/2/f42e32ea9361c740cbb968ee21d15749691f747c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|a|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/2/9029bad227e01fff796f99ec7bc182acbe4ea203.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is greater than or equal to zero, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab0d6b0f629cdfba5b6ce68695ff0c5a2d6fd8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-a$\" width=\"23\" height=\"8\" /> if a is less than or equal to zero; the symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/2/262a080d0d87e973b817945967a512346d8bfc49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&lt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> means \"less than\"; \nthe symbol <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f0cdbd0dbecd281387229d95a014017a0a395a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$&gt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> means \"greater than.\"\nThe set of values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying the inequality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe2990a178bf15b811c28c1f6b4e818a12eb686a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-x|&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" /> consists of all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/e/f3ee77ec9950c01e957ace072db2c3a5010c698f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ x^2&lt;49 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ x^2&gt;1 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1&lt;x^2&lt;49\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ -1&lt;x&lt;7\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ -7&lt;x&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"706\" height=\"19\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd6d430ffad9d33c1432e5da810280aa1ef7582.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|3-x| &lt; 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"18\" /> can be solved by splitting it into two inequalities: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43d12aca26a9b1b2141de3f0c580e72efbee658b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-x&lt;4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf7ca2e51bb734e49f6fa4e55cffa75200f56999.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-x&gt;-4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />. The solutions to those inequalities are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/8/4188531d052e4f644be1a476463b46bffe74ce97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&gt;-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/e/7deb79cdfc8a507ba781678bfef89b608bb8f4c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, respectively. The common interval of those two inequalities is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea47d27472c2382723d139f006a762a03d583e92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ -1&lt;x&lt;7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"147\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1